              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "note",
                  "id": "zacIt",
                  "name": "A11y note",
                  "width": 560,
                  "height": 0,
                  "content": "Accessibility\n\nMenu / DropdownMenu: roving focus (arrow keys move between items), role=menu / role=menuitem, Esc closes and focus returns to the trigger; disabled items are skipped.\n\nCommandPalette: focus trap inside the panel, the input is focused on open, full keyboard navigation (↑ ↓ move, ↵ select), Esc closes and restores focus to the previously focused element.\n\nTooltip / Popover: shown on hover and focus; Esc dismisses; non-modal (focus is not trapped)."
                },
                {
                  "type": "note",
                  "id": "y7nCn",
                  "name": "Responsive note",
                  "width": 560,
                  "height": 0,
                  "content": "Responsive (per prompt 07)\n\nCommandPalette: on mobile the panel is full-width near the top (or a full-height sheet); results scroll; rows stay ≥44px for touch.\n\nMenu / OrgSwitcher menu: on mobile open as a bottom sheet over the $overlay scrim instead of a small anchored popover.\n\nTooltip: hover tooltips are pointer-only; on touch they do not apply (no mobile specimen needed).\n\nOrgSwitcher: the rail variant is used inside the collapsed sidebar and the mobile drawer."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
